  // isRowSelectable, isRowSelectionLocked, groupBy, renderGroupHeader, rowSelectLabel, renderExpanded, rowActions, rowActionsLabel, rowState, rowClassName,
  // rowStyle, onRowClick, onRowDoubleClick, keyboardNavigation, density, unstyled, layout, renderCard, messages) plus
  //   rows   — the rows to draw
  //   offset — 0-based position of rows[0] in the whole result (server mode: (page - 1) * pageSize).
  //   columnChooser — optional: cells carry data-dt-col (the table's browser script adds it when missing).
  //            A row without `rowId` / `id` is identified by offset + its index.
  // With layout "cards" and renderCard the rows are the card grid's <li>s (kui-react DataTable card layout).
